OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 10 MAY
OL,4,G0600FAfrodeutsche
OL,5,     GEase into your Sunday with
OL,6,     GAfrodeutsche.
OL,7,G0800FRadcliffe and Maconie
OL,8,     GStuart Maconie soundtracks a
OL,9,     Grelaxing morning by a riverbank,
OL,10,     Gas part of 6 Music's Slow Sunday.
OL,11,     GWith riverside-themed tracks and
OL,12,     Gchat, including music from Nick
OL,13,     GDrake, Ibeyi and Can.
OL,14,G1000FCerys Matthews
OL,15,     GThis Slow Sunday, Cerys will help
OL,16,     Gyou escape up into the sky and
OL,17,     Gacross to the African desert,
OL,18,     Gcourtesy of Saharan rock band
OL,19,     GTamikrest and author Simon Barnes.
